fixes and reproduction notes are available; independent reproduction is not established.</p><p>Experimental extensions remain unadopted; independent third-party reproduction has not been established. The results below are first-party CI and internal research checks, not an independent assessment, certification, production-readiness determination or proof of complete observation.</p><p><a href="https://veritaschain.org/vso/announcements/2026-11-05-vap-research-sdk-reproduction/">Read the update and source records</a></p><div id="original-main-ci-20261105"><h3>5 November follow-up: site main CI completed</h3><p>Website main <code>a18cda8</code> completed all five workflows and 12 jobs, including 110 image comparisons, 55 regression tests and a 428-page CSP crawl. Chinese VeraSnap image pairs matched exactly at desktop and mobile widths. Comparison criteria were not relaxed.</p><p>This is first-party website CI, not an independent reproduction result. Experimental extensions remain unadopted; independent reproduction is not established. Historical test records remain attached to their original revisions.</p><p><a href="https://veritaschain.org/vso/announcements/2026-11-05-vap-research-sdk-reproduction/#main-ci-20261105">Read the main CI completion results and scope</a></p></div></section></div></details></div></li><li class="news-row" id="github-corrections-20261103" data-news-record data-month="2026-11" data-category="research"><div class="news-meta"><time datetime="2026-11-03">2026-11-03</time></div><div><h3><a href="https://veritaschain.org/vso/announcements/2026-11-03-verification-status-explorer-corrections/">VSO updates verification-status disclosures and the public Explorer</a></h3><p class="news-summary">VAP source/hash, public Explorer and 23 merged corrections. First-party checks are distinct from independent reproduction; experimental extensions remain unadopted.</p><details class="archive-record" id="github-corrections-20261103-record"><summary>Read the arc